# Screaming like a pig
# High leval parrallel oxbox on right on main passage
# Discovered 16.11.96
# Gavin Lowe, Steve Roberts, Nathaniel Mumford, Jonathan Cooper
# Surveyed 23.11.96
# Jonathan Cooper, Ian Benson, Fleur Loveridge, Alison Waterfall
# Book JC, Instr Ian, Tape Fleur
# Survey out of cave

survey pigscream
centreline
  # BCRA2
  sd length 0.5 metres
  sd compass clino 2.5 degrees
  calibrate compass 4.2
  data normal from to length compass clino
  1	2	30.5	012	7	# St.1 Window looking out over main
  # passage. Climb on right.
  3	2	11.6	156	-6	# St.2 Rift on left to main passage
  3	4	10.2	010	-11
  5	4	6.4	176	-8	# Dig in corner of passage
  6	4	6.2	286	5
  6	7	27.2	024	5	# St.7 Large window down to main passage
  8	7	25.0	202	-5	# Dig in corner on right
  8	9	7.8	086	-33	# St.9=Moresex.5
endcentreline
endsurvey

# Survey of 'the clique' sidepassage to MSAD, OD
# Entered and surveyed Pauline Rigby, Tim Guliford, Jonathan Cooper
# 24.11.96
# Book PAR, instruments TCG, tape JC
# Instrument Set ?
# zerocli readings are guessed!

survey clique
# From   To      Tape    Compass Clino
centreline
  # BCRA2
  sd length 0.5 metres
  sd compass clino 2.5 degrees
  calibrate compass 4.2
  data normal from to length compass clino
  2	1	2.6	013	+15	# 1 = a dig
  3	2	12.6	312.5	0
  4	3	2.9	342	0
  5	4	10.6	320.5	0
  6	5	7.1	290	0	# 6 = back in main passage
  7	6	8.8	010	-24
  8	7	9.1	354	0	# 8 = MSAD station 5
endcentreline
endsurvey

